\ Not supported (plan row 9.4.8z12, small tactics 2): an odd count of
\ terms. Lean's first step may be a term alone (calc a, meaning a = _ :=
\ rfl), which has no LeanForth form: 99 (exit 2), never accepted.
theorem u_calc_odd
  Nat explicit: a  Nat explicit: b  a b = explicit: h1  a b =
:= by
  by-calc[ a  a b = ' h1 ]
end u_calc_odd
